gui for Debian
==============

This is a local packaging candidate, not an official Debian archive package.
Version 1.0-1~local3 targets unstable for clean-environment review.
That target does not publish the package or imply archive acceptance.
No ITP number or archive acceptance is implied by these files.

The package installs /usr/bin/gui and /usr/share/man/man1/gui.1.gz.
Preferences are stored per user under XDG_CONFIG_HOME/gui or ~/.config/gui;
there are no package-managed global configuration files.

A previous manual installation at /usr/local/bin/gui can take precedence
over this package. Run /usr/bin/gui explicitly to test the Debian executable.
This package does not remove or overwrite a manually installed local copy.

See docs/debian-packaging.md in the upstream source repository for building,
checking with Lintian, and preparing a future Debian sponsorship request.
